* Manual Ch.9 p.125: keyword FENCE succeeds L-to-R but FAILS the match on backup.
 '1AB+' ? ANY('AB') FENCE '+'   :S(Y)F(N)
Y OUTPUT = 'matched'            :(N2)
N OUTPUT = 'fenced'
N2 'ABC' ? FENCE 'B'            :S(Y2)F(N3)
Y2 OUTPUT = 'anchor-broke'      :(END)
N3 OUTPUT = 'fence-first anchors'
END
